    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $('Normalize Intake Data').item.json.email }}",
        "subject": "Your Case Evaluation Request – Mitchell & Chen Law Group",
        "message": "=<p>Dear {{ $('Normalize Intake Data').first().json.full_name }},</p>  <p>Thank you for contacting Mitchell & Chen Law Group and for taking the time to share the details of your situation.</p>  <p>After reviewing your request, we regret to inform you that our firm is unable to represent you in this matter. This decision is not an opinion on the merits of your case.</p>  <p>Please be aware that legal claims are subject to strict deadlines, known as statutes of limitations. We strongly encourage you to consult with another attorney as soon as possible to protect your rights. If you need a referral, your local or state bar association can help you find a qualified lawyer.</p>  <p>We wish you the best in resolving this matter.</p>  <p>Sincerely,<br> Client Intake Team<br> Mitchell & Chen Law Group</p>  <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#777;\">This message does not create an attorney-client relationship and does not constitute legal advice.</p>",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        2192,
        96
